    <description><![CDATA[<p>Each Sunday, Pitchfork takes an in-depth look at a significant album from the past, and any record not in our archives is eligible. Today, we look back at one of the best-selling albums of all time and consider what it says about the unbelievable power of the Eagles and the kind of rock’n’roll they created.</p>
